Input trust and dependency hardening.

- getHost() only trusts the Host header: Forwarded and X-Forwarded-Host are
  client-controlled without an explicit trusted-proxy boundary, and Composery's
  supported edges (Caddy, the cloud proxy) preserve Host.
- An invalid COMPOSERY_IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS fails startup instead of being
  logged and ignored - a typo must not silently disable the timeout.
- package-lock pins js-yaml 4.3.0 and body-parser 2.3.0. The lockfile belongs
  to the pinned upstream submodule, so Renovate cannot manage these hunks; the
  stack-apply test asserts the assembled runtime stays on the fixed versions
  across upstream bumps.

